WEBVTT

00:28.840 --> 00:33.560
Friendship. Everyone says it's priceless.

00:34.640 --> 00:39.240
It's even more priceless
if it's a mixed-class friendship.

00:41.320 --> 00:46.560
But, the price of friendship,
how expensive could that be?

02:24.440 --> 02:29.760
3 MONTHS EARLIER

03:32.960 --> 03:33.800
Let's go.

03:44.800 --> 03:46.120
Here, Yuri.

03:46.600 --> 03:49.720
Stop using the old one.
Can't you see it's all torn?

03:51.920 --> 03:56.040
Oh, that's okay.
You bought me ice cream yesterday.

03:56.600 --> 03:59.680
What? You're overthinking.
It's so old. Why are you still using it?

03:59.760 --> 04:00.600
Take this one.

04:00.680 --> 04:01.520
Here.

04:03.840 --> 04:05.600
For the sake of our friendship.

04:14.760 --> 04:17.280
Why aren't Nana and Tubtim friends
with the preppy ones?

04:17.360 --> 04:19.440
Donating a bag to Yuri like this…

04:19.520 --> 04:21.640
Doesn't Yuri feel like
she's pulling them down?

04:21.720 --> 04:24.760
Yes. If it were me, I would be
so embarrassed to be a hanger-on.

04:28.880 --> 04:30.520
How dare you say such a thing?

04:30.600 --> 04:32.280
Apologize to Yuri now.

04:35.400 --> 04:38.080
Yuri, if you hear
anything like this again,

04:38.720 --> 04:39.760
let us know.

04:40.400 --> 04:42.240
They're bitches.

05:23.120 --> 05:24.160
Excuse me.

05:25.200 --> 05:27.560
These are our desks.

05:29.960 --> 05:34.360
One, two, three, four.

05:35.080 --> 05:38.920
One, two, three.

05:39.000 --> 05:40.280
That means there's one spot left.

05:40.360 --> 05:42.880
Normally, it's full
with just the three of us sitting.

05:42.960 --> 05:45.120
Full? How so?

05:46.240 --> 05:48.240
Nana and Tubtim
use one chair to place their bags on.

05:49.120 --> 05:52.440
I see… That's too bad.

05:54.120 --> 05:58.040
So where would a new student
like me sit? All the spots are taken.

05:58.120 --> 05:59.720
Well, not all of them.

06:01.480 --> 06:02.600
Yes, they are,

06:02.680 --> 06:06.280
because no one would open up
to a new student like me.

06:07.120 --> 06:10.080
But the three of you
are not like the others.

06:10.720 --> 06:15.400
I can see it.
Your friendship isn't measured by wealth.

06:15.480 --> 06:17.600
So, I guess it's not measured
by a newcomer's arrival.

06:18.200 --> 06:19.080
Right?

06:37.320 --> 06:40.120
Nanno, you're a new student, right?

06:40.680 --> 06:41.520
Yes.

06:42.040 --> 06:45.520
Nanno, the new student. Nice to meet you.

06:47.720 --> 06:49.200
Let me tell you this.

06:49.680 --> 06:53.440
Normally, our group doesn't easily
accept new members.

06:54.680 --> 06:56.360
But I see you're new…

06:57.200 --> 06:59.120
so I'm going to give you a chance.

06:59.680 --> 07:00.520
So, what do you say?

07:01.560 --> 07:03.200
If you're going to stick with us,

07:03.280 --> 07:06.240
you've got to prove
that you're a true friend.

07:07.120 --> 07:10.840
A "true friend."
I understand this word perfectly.

07:11.600 --> 07:16.880
So, let's see if your definition
of a true friend is the same as ours.

07:19.000 --> 07:21.200
Of course, true friends.

07:58.840 --> 08:01.760
Nana, I have the answers.

08:21.960 --> 08:24.480
Hey, don't ever do that again.

08:25.080 --> 08:27.360
Our group doesn't do that kind of stuff.

08:28.440 --> 08:33.520
I thought being true friends meant
helping each other out with everything.

08:33.600 --> 08:35.400
But that almost got us in trouble.

08:36.800 --> 08:37.720
Right.

08:38.360 --> 08:39.600
I get it now.

08:42.039 --> 08:43.679
I'm hungry.

08:44.880 --> 08:47.120
My hand is sore from the test.

08:47.200 --> 08:50.840
That's true, it's very sore. And so tired.

08:53.720 --> 08:56.440
What do you both want to eat?
I'll go buy it for you.

08:57.000 --> 08:58.880
-Chicken with rice.
-Me too.

09:00.720 --> 09:03.440
Here, take the money. It's on me.

09:07.920 --> 09:08.760
Thank you.

09:19.600 --> 09:20.720
Well…

09:31.000 --> 09:32.000
Yuri,

09:32.560 --> 09:34.600
I want the sauce like Tubtim's.

09:36.320 --> 09:37.760
All right, I'll go change it for you.

09:37.840 --> 09:38.800
Thanks.

09:40.040 --> 09:43.480
And Yuri, sorry.
Why isn't there any gourd in my soup?

09:45.840 --> 09:47.000
I'll change it for you.

09:48.520 --> 09:50.320
-Please.
-Thanks.

09:59.880 --> 10:01.120
About time to eat.

10:06.840 --> 10:09.400
Yuri, I don't eat cucumber.

10:10.400 --> 10:11.600
Do you want them?

10:15.160 --> 10:17.000
You can put them on my plate.

10:18.800 --> 10:19.640
Here.

10:21.680 --> 10:22.560
You can have them all.

11:32.600 --> 11:35.800
I can't believe it.
She had the guts to come to school.

11:35.880 --> 11:37.000
What happened?

11:37.600 --> 11:38.560
Meen,

11:39.120 --> 11:40.920
she flirted with Tao, Nana's boyfriend.

11:41.960 --> 11:43.640
Yuri was so angry.

11:44.200 --> 11:46.600
So, she created a fake Instagram account
to attack Meen for me.

11:47.680 --> 11:49.000
Yuri, you're good.

11:50.640 --> 11:52.320
Meen seems very scared of you all.

11:55.840 --> 11:57.600
It's all thanks to you, Yuri.

11:58.320 --> 12:01.000
If it weren't for you, I'd be doomed.

12:01.560 --> 12:04.240
That's true.
Oh, and the tutorial sheet you sent us.

12:04.320 --> 12:07.120
You see,
Yuri's very good at guessing the exam.

12:07.600 --> 12:10.360
Let's review the answers.

12:10.440 --> 12:11.640
One, two, three.

12:11.720 --> 12:13.120
-Three, four, two,
-Three, four, two,

12:13.200 --> 12:16.160
-two, one, two, three, one, four, one.
-two, one, two, three, one, four, two.

12:21.320 --> 12:23.360
You guys answered one
on the last question?

12:23.440 --> 12:25.600
Yes. I also answered one.

12:35.000 --> 12:37.120
I want to change my answer.

12:52.720 --> 12:57.520
Of course. True friends
help each other out all the way.

12:57.600 --> 12:59.000
Let me help you.

13:40.200 --> 13:43.520
So, am I accepted into the group?

13:56.480 --> 13:58.000
Bye-bye, my friends.

14:49.480 --> 14:53.280
Your definition of a true friend
is being a servant?

14:54.320 --> 14:57.080
What are you talking about?
Who's the servant?

14:57.160 --> 14:58.600
We're all friends.

14:58.680 --> 15:00.280
Friends…

15:00.360 --> 15:02.840
a friend who runs errands,

15:03.520 --> 15:05.600
a friend who makes a tutorial sheet,

15:06.160 --> 15:08.840
a friend who creates a fake account
to attack the ones we don't like,

15:08.920 --> 15:11.200
a friend who risks getting caught
to change an answer on a test sheet,

15:11.280 --> 15:13.520
all in exchange for money.

15:13.600 --> 15:15.400
It's no different from a servant.

15:18.440 --> 15:23.680
"Money transferred for changing
the answer, XOXO, Nana."

15:26.360 --> 15:28.000
Don't be so naive.

15:29.800 --> 15:33.480
I know that you were lingering,

15:34.080 --> 15:36.560
so the price would go higher.

15:37.360 --> 15:41.920
And you were upset
that I took that job before you did.

15:58.920 --> 16:01.720
And so? What's wrong with it?

16:02.640 --> 16:06.880
I just get my job done,
being a servant for them to use.

16:09.840 --> 16:13.080
Well-paid jobs aren't easy to find.

16:17.480 --> 16:19.400
Yuri, you're pretty interesting.

16:20.960 --> 16:22.680
There's nothing interesting.

16:24.600 --> 16:28.200
Let me ask you straight.
Is money really that important to you?

16:39.320 --> 16:40.200
Yes, it is.

17:08.240 --> 17:09.400
I'm back.

17:11.640 --> 17:12.480
Oh, my.

17:12.560 --> 17:13.960
I'm Nanno, Yuri's friend.

17:14.560 --> 17:15.599
Hello, dear.

17:16.319 --> 17:17.480
It's nice meeting you, ma'am.

17:17.560 --> 17:20.680
Have you two eaten yet?
I got fried pork with chili and basil.

17:20.760 --> 17:21.680
All right, I'll eat it.

17:24.680 --> 17:26.000
I bought you a new phone.

17:28.640 --> 17:31.720
But isn't this expensive?
Where did you get the money?

17:31.800 --> 17:35.080
Well… my friends hired me to tutor them.

17:39.360 --> 17:41.160
Here, let me teach you how to use it.

17:42.360 --> 17:43.360
Here.

17:44.480 --> 17:49.200
There, isn't it pretty?
This is the latest model.

17:49.280 --> 17:51.560
So, you won't have to watch
just from the TV.

17:51.640 --> 17:53.280
You can also watch everything from here,

17:53.800 --> 17:55.640
so you won't get lonely
when I'm not around.

17:57.440 --> 17:59.560
You've got such nice friends.

18:02.720 --> 18:06.200
There, we're going to have
our first photo together!

18:08.360 --> 18:09.480
How do I do that?

18:09.560 --> 18:12.440
Do you see this camera icon?

18:12.520 --> 18:14.520
You just tap it. That's all. If you want…

18:14.600 --> 18:16.600
It's not that I don't want real friends.

18:19.760 --> 18:21.360
But look at the place where I live.

18:22.920 --> 18:24.400
And with my social status…

18:27.000 --> 18:29.120
I don't see any other way
that would help me

18:29.200 --> 18:30.400
other than taking these jobs.

18:33.920 --> 18:37.120
Rich people always
see the poor this way, don't they?

18:40.320 --> 18:42.520
Be the ones they make merit for…

18:44.720 --> 18:46.240
or throw leftovers for.

18:48.480 --> 18:50.760
Be the ornaments that
make them look like good people…

18:54.720 --> 18:57.760
but never to be accepted
as one of their kind.

19:04.680 --> 19:07.080
Nana and Tubtim are like most rich people…

19:10.640 --> 19:13.280
who almost make me think
that I might really have real friends,

19:14.560 --> 19:16.520
or have a backup when needed.

19:23.320 --> 19:27.640
I used to think,
what if one day, I get rich,

19:28.560 --> 19:30.160
richer than them,

19:31.800 --> 19:34.080
maybe I'll try to do the same to them.

19:42.920 --> 19:46.840
"Here, Nana, I've already
transferred the money to you."

19:46.920 --> 19:48.560
"Thanks for cleaning up dog shit."

19:50.880 --> 19:54.080
"Hey Tubtim, here's your new bag."

19:54.160 --> 19:57.480
"I can't stand it
if you're using that lousy bag."

20:00.480 --> 20:02.840
Or I might do
exactly the same as what they did.

20:04.280 --> 20:07.120
"Here, I've transferred the money to you."

20:07.960 --> 20:10.560
"Thanks for this amazing friendship."

20:15.520 --> 20:17.600
Fucking amazing friendship, isn't it?

20:19.440 --> 20:21.400
Actually, you can do it, you know.

20:25.960 --> 20:27.000
Do what?

20:29.640 --> 20:33.840
Everything you've just said,
you can do it, you know?

20:36.960 --> 20:40.520
How can I do that? I don't have money.

20:40.600 --> 20:41.560
I don't have anything.

20:41.640 --> 20:42.560
You can do it.

20:43.400 --> 20:46.160
If you have something
rich people are afraid of.

20:50.160 --> 20:51.240
What is it?

20:52.880 --> 20:54.040
Their secrets.

20:57.000 --> 20:58.360
Yuri, you do know…

20:59.840 --> 21:05.440
Nana and Tubtim have some secrets hidden.

21:17.920 --> 21:20.360
Come on. Let's take a selfie, Yuri.

21:21.120 --> 21:22.200
One, two, three.

21:23.040 --> 21:23.960
That's it.

21:24.760 --> 21:27.320
-Got it?
-Yes.

21:27.400 --> 21:28.800
Yuri, you go work on the BBQ.

21:30.360 --> 21:31.680
Nanno, please get me some water.

21:31.760 --> 21:34.160
Those two are hiding something
in that laptop.

21:35.960 --> 21:38.360
That laptop is in Nana's bedroom,

21:39.880 --> 21:41.960
but she has never let me
reach it even once.

21:47.880 --> 21:49.600
I don't think it's difficult.

21:50.400 --> 21:54.800
All I ask is that you
keep Nana and Tubtim distracted.

21:57.000 --> 21:58.360
-What do you think?
-Let's make it--

21:58.440 --> 21:59.480
Oh, gosh!

21:59.560 --> 22:00.680
I'm sorry.

22:01.280 --> 22:02.720
Nanno!

22:02.800 --> 22:04.640
Do you want Nanno to get you a new shirt?

22:05.720 --> 22:06.680
Hurry up!

22:07.960 --> 22:09.200
It's all wet.

22:14.840 --> 22:16.320
She's so clumsy.

22:33.680 --> 22:34.520
Yuri.

22:37.960 --> 22:39.280
This isn't cooked yet.

23:22.800 --> 23:24.320
Not transferred yet?

25:09.760 --> 25:12.280
So… you're awake now?

25:18.680 --> 25:19.920
I'm sorry, Nanno.

25:22.600 --> 25:23.640
Sorry?

25:26.200 --> 25:27.160
I'm really sorry.

25:27.240 --> 25:28.800
You don't have to be sorry, Yuri.

25:30.320 --> 25:32.960
You can't just be sorry for everyone
who gets into this room.

25:33.560 --> 25:35.080
Be professional.

25:41.760 --> 25:44.960
Nanno, did you really think
that Yuri would betray us?

25:46.880 --> 25:49.680
And did you really think
that you were helping Yuri?

25:50.720 --> 25:55.680
Everything has been planned by us
from the beginning.

25:57.000 --> 25:58.880
Ever since you were accepted
into the group.

26:05.280 --> 26:09.280
Didn't you wonder why
the laptop didn't need a password?

26:21.640 --> 26:24.160
How is it, being a heroine for a while?

26:24.640 --> 26:25.480
Was it fun?

26:29.160 --> 26:31.040
Yuri, betraying us?

26:33.000 --> 26:37.760
No way. She's like a dog
who's loyal to her owner.

26:53.160 --> 26:54.600
A loyal dog?

26:59.840 --> 27:01.480
I don't think she's a loyal dog.

27:03.000 --> 27:05.400
She's just another stupid person.

27:07.560 --> 27:09.720
Yuri, do you want to be a dog forever?

27:10.440 --> 27:12.120
Woof!

27:13.400 --> 27:15.200
Or do you want to be an owner?

27:21.320 --> 27:25.040
If you want to be an owner,
do you want my help?

27:41.480 --> 27:42.520
Why the fuck are you laughing?

27:43.160 --> 27:45.000
I'm laughing at your stupidity.

27:46.600 --> 27:48.920
So, where is the guy who will rape me--

27:49.000 --> 27:52.520
You stop it. I'm calling them right now.

27:53.560 --> 27:54.520
Hurry up.

27:56.120 --> 27:58.360
Do you think I'm scared
of having sex with men?

27:58.440 --> 28:00.160
Don't be a smart-mouth, Nanno.

28:00.760 --> 28:02.720
Your life is in our hands.

28:02.800 --> 28:04.920
Well…

28:05.400 --> 28:07.320
I think it's the other way around.

28:07.880 --> 28:12.120
Earlier, I uploaded all the evidence
to the cloud.

28:14.080 --> 28:17.080
And there aren't only
the clips of students being raped.

28:17.840 --> 28:20.320
There's also evidence of purchases

28:20.400 --> 28:23.600
with your names, Nana, Tubtim,

28:23.680 --> 28:25.640
and Yuri on it.

28:26.240 --> 28:28.200
So hurry up and do
whatever you want to do.

28:39.000 --> 28:40.720
What the fuck is wrong with you?

28:42.280 --> 28:43.520
Shut up!

28:45.440 --> 28:46.480
I said shut up!

28:50.240 --> 28:51.640
I'm telling you to shut the fuck up!

28:52.560 --> 28:54.880
Yuri! Do something!

28:54.960 --> 28:56.520
-What do you want me to do?
-Shut her up!

28:57.840 --> 28:59.840
You want money, right? Is 20,000 enough?

29:00.800 --> 29:03.000
-I'll give you another 20,000.
-That's 40,000!

29:03.080 --> 29:05.040
Is that enough?
Why are you still standing?

29:05.120 --> 29:07.360
Make her shut up! Hurry!

29:08.360 --> 29:09.760
Hurry up!

29:10.400 --> 29:11.480
Yuri.

29:16.080 --> 29:18.000
Don't you see that she's smiling?

29:19.280 --> 29:20.320
You…

30:32.720 --> 30:36.720
Yuri. Take care of the body.

30:38.400 --> 30:41.520
Put her in a tub.
Make it look like suicide.

30:46.000 --> 30:47.280
Why are you taking so long?

30:51.320 --> 30:54.080
I think you two are the ones
who are going to take care of the body…

30:59.120 --> 31:01.160
because I have evidence
of you killing a person.

31:08.160 --> 31:10.680
What? Are you threatening us?

31:11.440 --> 31:12.880
Know your place.

31:16.800 --> 31:18.600
All these times I've been with you,

31:21.960 --> 31:26.240
you wanted me to be a victim
and I was one for you.

31:32.200 --> 31:34.040
You loved paying me to do things…

31:36.160 --> 31:37.520
and I did it.

31:41.560 --> 31:46.240
You had me fool everyone down here
with my innocent demeanor and I did it.

31:49.480 --> 31:54.600
You wanted a loyal dog… and I became one.

31:58.760 --> 32:00.320
Was there anything I couldn't do?

32:08.760 --> 32:11.760
The plan Nanno told me to get you guys

32:13.680 --> 32:15.440
was what I've been thinking about
all along.

32:19.520 --> 32:20.520
Come in, guys.

32:34.400 --> 32:35.320
Don't.

32:36.760 --> 32:41.760
Before we start having fun,
take care of this body.

32:43.600 --> 32:46.200
Put her in a tub and make it look like
she committed suicide, right?

32:46.800 --> 32:47.880
Do it.

32:55.000 --> 32:56.720
I'm talking to you, Nana and Tubtim.

33:03.240 --> 33:06.880
Yuri, I beg you.

33:08.640 --> 33:10.480
Normally, you give orders.

33:10.560 --> 33:12.520
Why don't you try
doing it by yourselves this time?

33:13.640 --> 33:16.360
Don't do anything to us. Please.

33:16.440 --> 33:18.080
I told you to take care of this!

33:24.680 --> 33:25.680
Do it.

34:00.080 --> 34:01.320
How much do you want?

34:02.760 --> 34:03.800
How much?

34:03.880 --> 34:05.240
A hundred thousand.

34:07.160 --> 34:09.400
That's the price of your freedom?

34:10.000 --> 34:11.040
One million.

34:11.600 --> 34:13.120
Wow, your freedom is that cheap?

34:14.080 --> 34:15.120
Ten million.

34:16.920 --> 34:18.320
How much do you want?

34:24.120 --> 34:26.040
What you did to others…

34:28.000 --> 34:29.719
cannot be priced.

34:32.600 --> 34:34.199
It should be counted as pain.

34:36.520 --> 34:37.960
How many video clips have you made?

34:39.560 --> 34:41.800
How many are there…

34:42.560 --> 34:45.199
One, two, three, four…

34:45.280 --> 34:47.280
Wow, countless times.

34:51.239 --> 34:52.960
You guys do them
as many times as you want.

34:53.040 --> 34:54.679
I just want to record
a bit of it on video.

34:54.760 --> 34:56.080
Don't do it.

35:03.720 --> 35:04.880
Don't?

35:11.160 --> 35:12.480
That sounds familiar.

35:16.880 --> 35:19.360
Wasn't that what I said to you
when you guys did it to me?

35:38.640 --> 35:40.160
And what did you tell me that day?

35:44.880 --> 35:47.200
"I can't help it, you're just stupid."

35:48.600 --> 35:49.840
Go on, guys.

35:50.640 --> 35:51.920
No.

35:52.000 --> 35:53.720
-No.
-Yuri, let me go.

35:53.800 --> 35:55.400
-No!
-Please!

35:55.480 --> 35:56.600
Yuri!

36:35.200 --> 36:39.160
Thank you, Nanno, for offering me help.

36:41.000 --> 36:42.200
But I'm sorry…

36:43.360 --> 36:45.480
a girl like me doesn't need any help.

36:46.360 --> 36:47.760
I want a victim.

36:50.240 --> 36:53.680
Stupid? You think I'm stupid?

36:56.560 --> 37:00.200
The reason I put up with
the pain that I endured

37:01.520 --> 37:03.720
was that I was waiting for
the time for revenge,

37:03.800 --> 37:05.560
a perfect one, that's all.

37:13.760 --> 37:15.840
I fooled you to get to the laptop

37:18.080 --> 37:19.600
not because I wanted the clips,

37:22.320 --> 37:24.840
but because I wanted
all of the customers' information

37:25.560 --> 37:27.840
so I could sell them myself.

37:32.200 --> 37:33.240
Now,

37:34.560 --> 37:36.120
I am the owner of everything.

37:45.440 --> 37:46.760
I'll have the money transferred.

39:33.520 --> 39:35.160
If you're not stupid, Yuri,

39:36.240 --> 39:38.560
things will be more interesting.

39:49.760 --> 39:52.000
Friendship has its own price.

39:52.760 --> 39:55.720
Sometimes, the price
is higher than you think.

39:56.400 --> 39:58.800
So high that

39:59.440 --> 40:01.800
it'll cost you your life.

41:39.160 --> 41:44.160
Subtitle translation by:
Tanada Hantaweewatana
